---
// "What you get" — three payoff cards (verbatim port).
---

<section class="payoff">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="payoff__header">
      <div class="dimension-label">What you get</div>
    </div>
    <div class="payoff__grid">
      <div class="payoff-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="payoff-card__title">See your system</div>
        <div class="payoff-card__text">
          Import your repo. Get a map of every behavior - states, actions,
          conditions, data flows. In minutes.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="payoff-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="payoff-card__title">Change with confidence</div>
        <div class="payoff-card__text">
          See what you're affecting before you touch it. Describe changes in
          English. Review before it commits.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="payoff-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="payoff-card__title">Intent that survives</div>
        <div class="payoff-card__text">
          Every behavior captured with its WHY. Not documentation that rots but
          structure that verifies.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
